<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amalgamated year net down 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amalgamated year net down 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    57.46 vs 54.87</p>
<p>    Net				     38.04 vs 40.65</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     5.0  vs 16.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Amalgamated Holdings Ltd is a cinema, hotel and resort operator.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    36.0  vs 28.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  355.73 vs 320.09</p>
<p>    Other income			  20.24 vs  13.49</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  131.5  vs 131.2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs loss 3.24</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 21</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 31</p>
<p>    Tax				     19.33 vs  10.98</p>
<p>    Interest				11.19 vs  10.39</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  16.87 vs  14.29</p>
<p>NOTE: Amalgamated has announced a bonus issue of three ordinary shares for every one ordinary share held at the record date. The five cent final dividend is paid on the increased capital. A final ordinary dividend of 20 cents per share pre-bonus issue will be paid.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
